WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.494
A thousand years ago they saved Howlem by sacrificing themselves.

2
00:00:06.494 --> 00:00:11.671
But nothing disappears completely, they are still here in the Tree...

3
00:00:12.671 --> 00:00:16.254
They were with their people, saw their joys and troubles...

4
00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:21.489
It is enough just to call... They will respond, I can feel it...

5
00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:28.487
You were fast as lightning, but now you are fast asleep, Val. I'm sorry.

6
00:00:29.487 --> 00:00:36.967
You have seen the peaks of the highest mountains, but eternal dreams have seized you, Orn. I'm sorry.

7
00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:46.052
I feel... a living Thread calling for help...

8
00:00:47.052 --> 00:00:51.906
It beats like a heart... But we need more power, otherwise I won’t be able to pull it out.

9
00:00:52.906 --> 00:00:57.228
Yes, I see the outlines, as though through a fog... But more power is needed.

10
00:00:58.228 --> 00:01:06.102
Yes, it's a squirrel - I see the silhouette now. It's sleeping. I need more power to wake it up.

11
00:01:07.102 --> 00:01:15.678
It… woke up. Ratatoskr! The squirrel that jumps between the branches of the Great Ash Tree.

12
00:01:16.678 --> 00:01:30.885
We can speak with the goddess! I can sense that the Tree has its own mind and its thoughts are linked with hers. But it won't be easy...
